    "stikcy_card_blocks_wr6wY3": {
      "type": "stikcy-card-blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "card_block_aNcE7W": {
          "type": "card_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_1_2438e2fe-81f7-4479-9e35-4085afc3f0d8.svg",
            "title": "Hot Flushes",
            "text": "<p>Sudden waves of heat, sweating and a flushed face. They appear from nowhere and stop you in your tracks. <br\/><br\/>Changing hormones can affect your body's temperature regulation. With the right treatment, they can be managed.<\/p>",
            "color_scheme_card": ""
          }
        },
        "card_block_dcKTim": {
          "type": "card_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_1_2438e2fe-81f7-4479-9e35-4085afc3f0d8.svg",
            "title": "Vaginal Discomfort",
            "text": "<p>The dryness, soreness, itching and increased sensitivity can really get you down. <\/p><p><br\/>This is caused by reduced oestrogen levels. A range of treatments are available to help ease the uncomfortable symptoms and restore vaginal health.<\/p>",
            "color_scheme_card": "scheme-32051e61-b6a4-4a5b-80c8-a81092a26e44"
          }
        },
        "card_block_j3JVtV": {
          "type": "card_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_1_2438e2fe-81f7-4479-9e35-4085afc3f0d8.svg",
            "title": "Night Sweats",
            "text": "<p>As hormonal fluctuations impact the body's temperature gauge, episodes of intense heat and perspiration can disrupt sleep. <\/p><p><br\/>We can help restore balance with the right treatment and lifestyle adjustments. <\/p>",
            "color_scheme_card": "scheme-12aabace-348a-4184-95ad-169e2a162b4f"
          }
        },
        "card_block_67en7P": {
          "type": "card_block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Brain Fog",
            "text": "<p>You forget things, can't focus and everything feels a bit fuzzy. Changing hormones affect cognitive function, which can feel very frustrating.<\/p><p><br\/>We'll look at lifestyle adjustments alongside your treatment to get you firing on all cylinders again. <\/p>",
            "color_scheme_card": "scheme-4"
          }
        },
        "card_block_YqKThi": {
          "type": "card_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_1_2438e2fe-81f7-4479-9e35-4085afc3f0d8.svg",
            "title": "Mood Changes",
            "text": "<p>Anxiety, irritability and low mood can take you away from yourself, impacting daily life.<\/p><p><br\/>This is usually linked to hormone imbalances affecting brain chemistry. You're not alone, and we're with you through every step.<\/p>",
            "color_scheme_card": "scheme-0b2cdb7d-d95a-4547-bcd4-83ea3c2172e9"
          }
        },
        "card_block_KV3PLN": {
          "type": "card_block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Low Energy",
            "text": "<p>The disrupted sleep, mental pressure and hormonal changes can leave you feeling depleted.<\/p><p><br\/>Making healthy lifestyle adjustments around diet, exercise and rest will maximise the results of your treatment.<\/p>",
            "color_scheme_card": "scheme-4"
          }
        }
      },
