          "type": "card_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Group_2141256187_2.png",
            "title": "Gina Vaginal Tablets",
            "text": "<p>Clinically proven to restore vaginal health post-menopause, the plant-derived active ingredient oestradiol targets vaginal dryness, soreness, itching, burning and pain during sex.<\/p>",
